    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "de05bb3f-bb7c-968a-5686-4e2ce448e383",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The University Centre development will consist of two multi-storey buildings of twelve and seven floors respectively as well as three basement levels. The new project will support the University's plans to add new programmes and facilities as it launches new schools of liberal arts and professional education.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Expressions of interests are invited from construction companies that have a proven track record in building high-rise institutional projects involving structural, civil, finishing, services and infrastructure work.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "For more details of opportunities, click ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "here ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
